    "detailed_description": "There is no interface, it's all sound. The biggest feature of &quot;Listen&quot; is that there is no screen display throughout the process, and everything is entered by the keyboard and mouse movement.<br>Listen is a first-person shooter where the goal is to destroy all enemy units. Navigate the map with limited sound prompts and power-ups to find and destroy enemy units while battling them without being destroyed by them. Or play a 1v1 blind typing battle with friends, find each other's location in the map, and hide your location.<br>Playing Listen tests listening and patience, calmly facing the game, and then facing life calmly.<br>The important thing is said three times: there is no interface! No interface! No interface!<br>Any questions and comments should be sent to <a href=\"mailto:3187501391@qq.com\">3187501391@qq.com</a><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540310/extras/0dcdc1d4873129b05ee9e82ae68d61e6.avif?t=1695223249\" data-has-big /></span>",
